  <p>Per the Sept. 29, 2026, <a href="https://www.whitehouse.gov/presidential-actions/2026/09/inaugurating-the-era-of-super-intelligence/">Executive Order 14434: Inaugurating the Era of Super Intelligence</a>, NSF is working to update its communications to incorporate the term "super intelligence" as directed.</p>


